Q: Upgraded to Entity Framework Core 10 and database connection string no longer works A: <p>I’m facing the same issue after uptdating to EF Core 10.0.3. I tried settting Encrypt= false, but without success.</p>
<p>I can establish a connection to the database by connecting directly like this:</p>
<pre><code>using (var sqlConn = new Microsoft.Data.SqlClient.SqlConnection(connString))
{
        await sqlConn.OpenAsync().ConfigureAwait(false);
        Console.WriteLine(&quot;SqlConnection aberta com sucesso.&quot;);
}
</code></pre>
<p>However, with EF Core just freeze after this:</p>
<pre><code>bool canConnect = await dbContext.Database.CanConnectAsync().ConfigureAwait(false);
</code></pre>
